OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died after being hit by
OL,4,Alorry named by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 58-year-old man who died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a lorry in Aberdeen has been
OL,8,Fnamed by police.
OL,10,FAntony Millard, from the Torry area of
OL,11,Fthe city, was pronounced dead at the
OL,12,Fscene of the incident which happened on
OL,13,FVictoria Road at about 10:10 on Friday.
OL,15,FSgt Chris Bain said: "Our inquiries
OL,16,Fremain ongoing and we continue to
OL,17,Fappeal to anyone who witnessed the
OL,18,Fcollision or who may have any relevant
OL,19,Fdashcam footage to contact police as it
OL,20,Fmay assist our inquiries."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
